C
      DATA CST/49.55190,22.92760,85.39050,103.4830,60.34980,0.568700,
     1 28.99750,0.323900,0.261500,0.230600,0.313600,0.380800,31.54720,
     2 0.678500,0.526000,0.253600,18.51940,43.89830,213.1870,85.74840,
